    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) A technical assistance notice must not be given orally unless:  (a) an imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial damage to property exists; and  (b) the technical assistance notice is necessary for the purpose of dealing with that risk; and  (c) it is not practicable in the circumstances to give the technical assistance notice in writing.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) A technical assistance notice must not be given orally unless:  (a) an imminent risk of serious harm to a person or substantial damage to property exists; and  (b) the technical assistance notice is necessary for the purpose of dealing with that risk; and  (c) it is not practicable in the circumstances to give the technical assistance notice in writing.";
