    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "BETWEEN";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The period of service must be between 5 years and the current time.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) has served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of 5 years; and (b) no longer holds a commission as a judge of a prescribed court.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person who is an assessor must have served as a judge in one or more prescribed courts for a period of time between 5 years and the current time.";
