    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) If a technical capability notice has been given to a person, and the Attorney-General is satisfied that: (a) the requirements imposed by the notice are not reasonable and proportionate; or (b) compliance with the notice is not: (i) practicable; and (ii) technically feasible;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the Attorney-General must, by written notice given to the person, revoke the notice.";
