    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Obligation to ensure adequate opportunity for representation and due consideration.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) Before making a technical standard under section 376, the ACMA must, so far as is practicable, try to ensure that:  (a) interested persons have had an adequate opportunity to make representations about the proposed standard (either directly, or indirectly by means of a report under paragraph (2)(g)); and  (b) due consideration has been given to any representation so made.";
