<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-541a> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "541A When is a thing connected with a breach of the Spam Act"@en;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/realizedBy> <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-act-1997#sec-541a>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/integrityHash> "3612cf8faede998d6934f7b192459393cf4157e158b22523accbb063dd1b8564";
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A thing is connected with a breach of the Spam Act if it is related to the breach.";
